WEBVTT

NOTE How to download and save your goodies. Captions match the words shown on screen; the video has no voiceover.

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.300
How to download and save your goodies. Sign in, download your file once, save it, and find it again.

2
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:13.660
Step 1: Sign in to your account, on a computer. Click the person icon at the top right of any page.

3
00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.760
Step 1: Sign in to your account, on a computer. Enter your email and password.

4
00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:21.400
Then click Sign in.

5
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:27.830
Step 1: Sign in to your account, on a phone. Tap the menu button at the top left.

6
00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:34.130
Step 1: Sign in to your account, on a phone. Tap Sign in.

7
00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:40.920
Step 1: Sign in to your account, on a phone. Enter your email and password, then tap Sign in.

8
00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:44.300
Step 2: Open My downloads. Your account opens.

9
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:48.300
Choose the My downloads tab.

10
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.920
Step 3: Find your resource. Each purchase has its own card, with the order number and version.

11
00:00:54.920 --> 00:01:00.000
Ready to save? It says 1 download available.

12
00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:06.000
Step 4: Before you download. Each digital purchase includes one download of the latest version.

13
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.910
Starting the download uses it. Just viewing the page does not.

14
00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:17.990
When a new version is released, you get one new download of it.

15
00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:26.220
Step 4: Start your download. When you're ready to save it, click or tap Download on the card.

16
00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:29.600
Step 4: Start your download. A reminder appears.

17
00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:34.680
Read it, then click or tap Download now.

18
00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:39.860
Step 5: Save the file. The website hands the file to your browser.

19
00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:44.580
Your browser saves it on your device.

20
00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:49.510
Step 5: Where your file goes. It depends on your device and settings. Usually:

21
00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:56.270
Computer: Your Downloads folder. If your browser asks where to save it, pick a folder you'll remember.

22
00:01:56.270 --> 00:02:03.750
iPhone or iPad: Safari saves it to the Files app, in Downloads. A Downloads button appears next to Safari's address bar.

23
00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:09.430
Android: Chrome saves it to your Downloads. You'll find it in the Files app.

24
00:02:09.430 --> 00:02:16.160
Tip: keep your inserts together in one folder, like one named Nurse Love.

25
00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:25.090
Step 6: Find it again. Computer: Open File Explorer on Windows or Finder on a Mac. Go to Downloads, or the folder you chose.

26
00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:30.410
iPhone or iPad: Open Files, tap Browse, then Downloads. Not there? Look in iCloud Drive.

27
00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:38.260
Android: Open the Files app and look in Downloads. Or in Chrome, tap More, then Downloads.

28
00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:43.800
Step 6: Check your file. My downloads now shows Download used and the date.

29
00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:49.790
The website can't see your device, so it can't tell if the file saved.

30
00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:55.230
Open the file once to make sure it's there.

31
00:02:55.930 --> 00:03:02.210
Step 7: Need help?. File didn't save or won't open? Click or tap Report a download problem.

32
00:03:02.210 --> 00:03:07.290
A person at the store reviews every report.

33
00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:13.910
Step 7: Need help?. For anything else, open Support in your account and send a message.

34
00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:17.910
You'll hear back by email.

35
00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:24.560
You're all set. Download once, save it somewhere easy to find, and open it to check.
